    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my bosch dishwasher is showing an e15 error code. i checked the manual but im not really sure what to do. how do i check the leak sensor and dry out the base?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The E15 error on a Bosch dishwasher typically indicates a moisture detection issue, often related to the leak sensor or excess water in the base. First, unplug the dishwasher completely and thoroughly dry the base of the unit, wiping up any visible puddles or moisture carefully. If the error persists, you may need to inspect the leak sensor itself, which is usually located near the bottom, and ensure it is clean and not blocked by debris.",
